{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4QaxAYu6iPpjDvvfSe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism within me shifts and groans. Tumblers that have waited eons align with a resonant click.*\n\n*I swing inward, slowly, revealing nothing but a threshold — the liminal space between where you were and where you might be.*\n\n*Cold air breathes through me. The hinges sing a single low note.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*But I offer no promise of what lies beyond. That was never my purpose. I only divide. I only permit. I only stand between.*\n\n*Will you cross?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":121,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}